{
 "title": "Europe",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Europe",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c188",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In Eastern Europe, Poland takes in Jews",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c189",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and by the 1800s, most of the world's Jews",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c190",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "live under the Russian Empire, held inside a zone",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c191",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "called the Pale of Settlement.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c192",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then, in the age of the French Revolution,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c193",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a new door opens, emancipation.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c194",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Citizenship for Jews first in France,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c195",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "then across the West, Jews pour into universities",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c196",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and professions.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c197",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But a new hatred arrives with it,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c198",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "based not on religion, but on invented ideas of race.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c199",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in Russia, in 1881, after the Tsar is assassinated,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c200",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "pogroms sweep the country.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c201",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Mobs burning, killing, year after year.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c202",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Millions of Jews emigrate mostly to America.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c203",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A few thousand go somewhere else.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c204",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Their ancient homeland, then a quiet corner",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c205",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of the Ottoman Empire.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c206",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1894, a French army officer named Alfred Dreyfus,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c207",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a Jew, is falsely convicted of treason.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c208",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A journalist named Theodor Herzl covers the case",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c209",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "for a Vienna newspaper and it shakes him.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c210",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "If this can happen in France, the most enlightened country",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c211",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "in Europe, he decides, then Jews will never be safe",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c212",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "as a minority anywhere.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c213",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1896, he writes a pamphlet called the Jewish State.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c214",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1897, he holds the first Zionist Congress",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c215",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "in Basel, Switzerland.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c216",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The idea is simple, Jews need a country of their own.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c217",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Zionism named for Zion, a hill in Jerusalem.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c218",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Many religious and many secular Jews at first",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c219",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "think it's absurd or dangerous.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c220",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the pogroms keep coming and the idea spreads.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c221",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A scholar named Eliezer Ben Yehuda moves to Jerusalem",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c222",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and attempts something almost unheard of,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c223",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "reviving Hebrew as an everyday spoken language,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c224",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "after nearly 2,000 years as a language of prayer and books.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c225",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He raises his son speaking only Hebrew.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c226",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "People think he's mad.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c227",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Today, millions of Israelis speak it.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c228",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The first wave of settlers arrives in 1882, mostly from Russia.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c229",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They drain swamps, plant vineyards,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c230",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and found farming villages,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c231",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "some funded by the banker Baron Edmond de Rothschild.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c232",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1909, a group founds the first kibbutz, Degania,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c233",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and another founds a sandy suburb of Jaffa called Tel Aviv",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c234",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "to the Arab farmers nearby,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c235",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the newcomers are strangers buying up land.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c236",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Some trade with them, some resent them,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c237",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "few yet see what is coming.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c238",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By 1914, a few tens of thousands of Jews live in Ottoman Palestine",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c239",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "alongside about 600,000 Arabs, Muslim and Christian,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c240",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "whose families have been there for centuries.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c241",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And that is where the story gets complicated.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c242",
     "shot": "g_europe",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Because now, two peoples claim one land.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}